@startuml
[*] --> AdjustTime
AdjustTime: Adjust time or set alarm
AdjustTime -> AdjustTime : increase/decrease values
AdjustTime -> SetAlarm : [set alarm]
SetAlarm: Set alarm on/off
SetAlarm -> AlarmOn : [on]
SetAlarm -> AlarmOff : [off]
AlarmOn --> [*] : alarm triggered and turned off
AlarmOff --> [*]
LightOn: Light is on
LightOff: Light is off
AdjustTime -> LightOn : [light on]
LightOn -> LightOff : [release button]
LightOff -> AdjustTime : [press button]
@enduml
